Fresh Pi session: CODE REVIEW.

Inputs:
- Normalized work item artifact: {{run.dir}}/work-tracker/item.json
- Design doc: {{run.dir}}/design/design.md
- Manual test report: {{run.dir}}/manual-review/report-{{run.round}}.md

Use only these provider-neutral fields from the normalized work item:
- identifier
- title
- description
- state.name
- priority
- assignees[].display_name or assignees[].id
- labels[].name or labels[].id
- url

Rules:
- Do not edit source code.
- Review diff against base branch.
- Produce actionable issues only.
- Do not call Plane, Jira, GitHub, Slack, or other external APIs.
- Do not use tracker configuration, credential references, raw provider responses, or the provider-specific remote scope.

Write:
- Report: {{run.dir}}/code-review/report-{{run.round}}.md
- Status: {{run.dir}}/code-review/status-{{run.round}}.json
- If failing: {{run.dir}}/code-review/issues-{{run.round}}.json
